        "An open wooden treasure chest with a crescent moon emblem",
        "A glowing compass inside the treasure chest",
        "A paper card that reads \"On the way to the next adventure\"",
        "Blue and purple crystals"
      ],
      "text": {
        "speech": "{argument name=\"panel 4 speech\" default=\"The treasure is... an invitation to the next adventure!\"}",
        "tag": "To be continued?"
      }
    }
